     1151             find FIRST buf_prod-bc where
     1152                         buf_prod-bc.b-code     = buf_goods.gds-code     and
     1153                         buf_prod-bc.bc-on = yes no-lock no-error.
     1154             if not available buf_prod-bc then do:
